  "meta": {
    "createdAt": "2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z",
    "notes": "A fetching pet. msm:tameable tames it one time in three with wheat seeds. collect_items makes it an item collector, as an allay: give it an item (use it with the item) and it picks up more of the same within 32 blocks and brings them to its owner, or to a note block it heard play; use it with an empty hand to take the item back. msm:shoulder_riding lets it perch on its owner's shoulder; sides left keeps it to the left one, so a second pet (or a parrot) can take the right. It is small (scale 0.5), as a shoulder pet must be.",
